# Google OAuth 2.0 Web application client ID.
#
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   Credentials -> Create credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application
#   Authorised JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in the value.
#
# This is PUBLIC — it ships in the JavaScript bundle and is meant to.
# The client SECRET is not public and must never be added to this project;
# it belongs only to server-side flows.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
